---
import GardenLayout from '../layouts/GardenLayout.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
const count=(await getCollection('blog')).length;
---
<GardenLayout title="煦意 · 一座慢慢生长的数字花园">
<div id="top"></div>
<section class="garden-hero"><div class="hero-writing"><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> WELCOME TO MY LITTLE CORNER</div><h1>把好奇心，<br/>种成一座<span>花园。</span></h1><p>你好，我是 XuYi。<br/>在这里学习、实验，也把走过的日子好好收藏。<br/>有些想法还很小，没关系，让它慢慢生长。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="garden-button" href="/review/">开始今日温习 <span>↗</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="/columns/old-notes/">翻翻往日手记 →</a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span>LEARNING</span><i>·</i><span>MAKING</span><i>·</i><span>REFLECTING</span></div></div><div class="garden-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 520 430" fill="none"><defs><pattern id="dot-grid" width="22" height="22" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r=".7" fill="#cdd3bd"/></pattern><linearGradient id="vase" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#e5e8d8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#b6c3a3"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x="30" y="25" width="465" height="355" fill="url(#dot-grid)" opacity=".6"/><ellipse cx="270" cy="345" rx="144" ry="29" fill="#e9ecdf"/><path d="M96 344H450" stroke="#bbc6aa"/><circle cx="274" cy="201" r="143" stroke="#d8dfcb" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/><ellipse cx="270" cy="210" rx="208" ry="63" transform="rotate(-28 270 210)" stroke="#c1cdb2"/><path d="M213 285L227 341Q268 360 309 341L323 285" fill="url(#vase)" stroke="#9caf8b"/><ellipse cx="268" cy="285" rx="55" ry="15" fill="#d2ddbf" stroke="#9caf8b"/><ellipse cx="268" cy="285" rx="43" ry="9" fill="#a1b18d"/><path d="M268 286C262 236 276 175 277 103M268 242C238 220 217 201 205 165M271 204C299 183 322 164 335 133M273 165C253 143 242 124 240 106" stroke="#748e63" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M277 137Q237 103 280 68Q312 109 277 137Z" fill="#bacba0" stroke="#7e996b"/><path d="M248 217Q198 217 186 169Q234 160 248 217Z" fill="#c7d5b2" stroke="#8da579"/><path d="M291 190Q296 140 342 131Q354 177 291 190Z" fill="#a6bd8f" stroke="#7c976a"/><path d="M258 147Q221 152 215 112Q248 96 258 147Z" fill="#d8e2c4" stroke="#8ca276"/><path d="M270 260Q303 211 350 233Q337 278 270 260Z" fill="#d5dfbc" stroke="#90a576"/><path d="M270 260L328 245M248 217L204 182M291 190L330 145M277 137L280 83" stroke="#8ca477"/><circle cx="115" cy="262" r="7" fill="#e6bd78" stroke="#c7a364"/><circle cx="403" cy="143" r="9" fill="#dce5cd" stroke="#98af7f"/><circle cx="371" cy="320" r="4" fill="#8da474"/><path d="M112 115H142M127 100V130" stroke="#a8b99a"/><text x="337" y="91" fill="#96a387" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="2">IDEAS TAKE ROOT.</text><text x="84" y="365" fill="#9aa58c" font-size="9" font-family="monospace" letter-spacing="2">A GARDEN, NOT A FINISH LINE.</text></svg><span class="art-caption">想法发芽的地方 / EST. XUYI</span></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">CURRENTLY EXPLORING</span><h2>此刻，把知识变成直觉。</h2></div><a class="quiet-link" href="/learn/">进入学习空间 ↗</a></div><a class="course-spotlight" href="/learn/robotics/"><div class="course-illustration"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 290" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M50 235H455M145 35V258" stroke="#46624e"/><path d="M55 70H450M55 115H450M55 160H450M55 205H450M100 35V258M190 35V258M235 35V258M280 35V258M325 35V258M370 35V258M415 35V258" stroke="#42604c" stroke-width=".5"/><circle cx="145" cy="235" r="173" stroke="#647c59" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/><path d="M145 235L267 156L349 70" stroke="#b5c596" stroke-width="13" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M145 235L267 156" stroke="#d9e8b4" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M267 156L349 70" stroke="#e3c897" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="145" cy="235" r="12" fill="#253f31" stroke="#d6e3b0" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="267" cy="156" r="9" fill="#253f31" stroke="#d6e3b0" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="349" cy="70" r="5" fill="#e6cf99"/><text x="176" y="214" fill="#adc497" font-family="serif" font-size="14">q₁</text><text x="257" y="119" fill="#adc497" font-family="serif" font-size="14">q₂</text><text x="360" y="65" fill="#cfb985" font-size="10" font-family="monospace">E (x, y)</text></svg><span>ROBO LAB / INTERACTIVE LEARNING</span></div><div class="course-copy"><div class="course-badges"><span>学习 · 001</span><span>交互实验室</span></div><h3>机器人学，<br/>从“看懂”到“会用”。</h3><p>转动坐标轴，搭建自己的机械臂。<br/>用看得见的运动，理解公式背后的几何。</p><div class="course-facts"><span>4 个实验</span><span>16 节讲解</span><span>53 道练习</span></div><div class="course-enter">开始探索 <span>↗</span></div></div></a></section>
<a class="daily-entry-banner" href="/review/"><div><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE EVERY DAY</div><h2>每天温习一点，让知识扎根。</h2><p>机器人学概念 · 考研词汇 · 名言摘录</p></div><span>翻开今天的卡片 ↗</span></a><section class="garden-bottom"><a class="archive-entry" href="/columns/old-notes/"><div class="eyebrow">THE WRITING ARCHIVE</div><div class="archive-card-title"><h2>往日手记</h2><span>↗</span></div><p>关于成长、选择、音乐与生活的那些文字。<br/>把过去收好，偶尔回来坐坐。</p><div class="archive-bottom"><span>{count} 篇文字 · 完整收藏</span><span>走进专栏 →</span></div></a><div class="garden-note"><div class="eyebrow">A NOTE TO MYSELF</div><blockquote>不必急着成为谁。<br/>认真学一点，<br/>踏实做一点。</blockquote><span class="note-sign">— 写给正在路上的自己</span></div></section>
</GardenLayout>
